  "description": "Implement IAcpAgent and drive a typed connection to the client, for the Agent Client\n      Protocol v2 line. Generated from the official schema and free of reflection.\n\n        PREVIEW: no agent implements ACP v2 yet. The schema is still tagged 2.0.0-alpha,\n        the reference Rust SDK gates v2 behind an opt-in unstable_protocol_v2 feature, and\n        the TypeScript SDK has no v2 surface at all. Use the V1 packages for anything real.",
